# Proxies /sitemap.xml on the Pages domain to the Worker's dynamically
# generated sitemap, so search engines see it under your real site's own
# domain (https://dastkar.pages.dev/sitemap.xml) instead of the workers.dev
# subdomain. Status 200 = a transparent proxy/rewrite, not a redirect — the
# URL in the browser/crawler stays /sitemap.xml.
#
# Replace with your actual Worker URL once deployed.
/sitemap.xml  https://dastkar-api.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev/api/sitemap.xml  200
